{
    "title": "STARSEED: Asnia Trigger",
    "description": "<font color=\"#fa147f\"><b>\u2763\ufe0f Receive a guaranteed SSR Proxyan daily. Get up to 33 SSR Proxyans for free!</b></font>\r\n<font color=\"#fa147f\"><b>\u2763\ufe0f New to the game? Log in for 7 days and get 5 SSR Proxyans, guaranteed!</b></font>\r\n\r\n- Official Website: https://starseed.com2us.com/\r\n\r\n\"Create hope for the future when the predestined destruction is at our doorstep.\"\r\nCollect Your Squad of AI Girls!\r\n\r\n< Game Overview >\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Discover the captivating narratives set in a virtual world!\r\nDiving into virtual reality, you are confronted by the Redshift, a hostile AI that has gone rogue to wreak havoc on humanity!\r\nBut fear not, because you\u2019re not alone in this wild ride. Get ready to team up with the stunning Proxyans, all armed with superintelligence!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Meet dazzling Proxyans of distinctive personalities!\r\nMeet beautiful Proxyans from the Seven Themes and discover their unique charms by bringing them into the fold.\r\nFeast your eyes on the Proxyans' Plugins, each with top-notch animation revealing their unlimited charms!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Stay up to date with Proxyans\u2019 daily life updates on Instarseed.\r\nThrough interaction, you can cultivate a deeper relationship with Proxyans.\r\nVisit Instarseed to check out your Proxyans\u2019 daily lives and communicate with them!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Master Academy classes.\r\nCustomize your own progress through special academy classes with adorable SD-style Proxyans.\r\nSelect your classmates and set up your own class schedule.\r\nBased on your class results, you can earn various buffs that maximize your Proxyans\u2019 power!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Maximize the thrill of playing diverse battle modes.\r\nExperience dynamic, vibrant skill animations firsthand.\r\nHarness the potential of Dual Ultimates to empower your Proxyans, and strategically deploy them across various game modes. Get ready to claim victory!\r\n\r\n***\r\nThis game is free to play, but you can choose to pay real money for extra items.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Supported Languages\r\nEnglish, \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4, \u4e2d\u6587\u7b80\u4f53, \u4e2d\u6587\u7e41\u9ad4, Deutsch, Fran\u00e7ais, Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t, \u0e44\u0e17\u0e22\r\n\r\n\u2022 Smartphone App Permissions \r\n\u25b6 Access Permissions\r\nRequesting permissions to provide the following services:\r\n\r\n[Required Permissions]\r\nNone.\r\n\r\n[Optional Permissions]\r\n- Notifications: Permission to send you advertising and/or informative notifications in the game.\r\n\r\n* Users are not required to allow Optional Permissions. However, this will restrict access to related features.\r\n* Individually setting Optional Permissions is not available for versions prior to Android 6.0. Upgrading to version 6.0 or later is recommended.\r\n\r\n\u25b6 Revoking App Permissions\r\nUsers can reset or revoke permissions after granting access.\r\n\r\n[OS 6.0 or Later]\r\nSettings > Manage Applications > Select App > Permissions > Grant/Revoke Permission\r\n\r\n[Versions Prior to OS 6.0]\r\nUpgrade OS and revoke permissions, or delete the app.\r\n\r\n***\r\n\u2022 Items are available for purchase in this game. Some paid items may not be refundable depending on the type of item. \r\n\u2022 Terms of Service: http://terms.withhive.com/terms/policy/view/M9/T1\r\n\u2022 Privacy Policy: http://terms.withhive.com/terms/policy/view/M9/T3\r\n\r\n\u2022 For questions or customer support, please contact our Customer Support by visiting http://customer-m.withhive.com/ask",
    "descriptionHTML": "<font color=\"#fa147f\"><b>\u2763\ufe0f Receive a guaranteed SSR Proxyan daily. Get up to 33 SSR Proxyans for free!</b></font><br><font color=\"#fa147f\"><b>\u2763\ufe0f New to the game? Log in for 7 days and get 5 SSR Proxyans, guaranteed!</b></font><br><br>- Official Website: https://starseed.com2us.com/<br><br>&quot;Create hope for the future when the predestined destruction is at our doorstep.&quot;<br>Collect Your Squad of AI Girls!<br><br>&lt; Game Overview &gt;<br><br>\u25a0 Discover the captivating narratives set in a virtual world!<br>Diving into virtual reality, you are confronted by the Redshift, a hostile AI that has gone rogue to wreak havoc on humanity!<br>But fear not, because you\u2019re not alone in this wild ride. Get ready to team up with the stunning Proxyans, all armed with superintelligence!<br><br>\u25a0 Meet dazzling Proxyans of distinctive personalities!<br>Meet beautiful Proxyans from the Seven Themes and discover their unique charms by bringing them into the fold.<br>Feast your eyes on the Proxyans&#39; Plugins, each with top-notch animation revealing their unlimited charms!<br><br>\u25a0 Stay up to date with Proxyans\u2019 daily life updates on Instarseed.<br>Through interaction, you can cultivate a deeper relationship with Proxyans.<br>Visit Instarseed to check out your Proxyans\u2019 daily lives and communicate with them!<br><br>\u25a0 Master Academy classes.<br>Customize your own progress through special academy classes with adorable SD-style Proxyans.<br>Select your classmates and set up your own class schedule.<br>Based on your class results, you can earn various buffs that maximize your Proxyans\u2019 power!<br><br>\u25a0 Maximize the thrill of playing diverse battle modes.<br>Experience dynamic, vibrant skill animations firsthand.<br>Harness the potential of Dual Ultimates to empower your Proxyans, and strategically deploy them across various game modes. Get ready to claim victory!<br><br>***<br>This game is